<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Four things we watch for</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card"><h3>Getting along</h3><p>Sharing, waiting, saying what you need, calming down. Cooperative play with a teacher nearby to help it go well.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Moving</h3><p>Climbing, balancing, pouring, cutting, drawing. Big movements and small ones, every day.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Language and early reading</h3><p>Stories, songs, and a lot of conversation in English. Phonics starts when a child is curious about letters, not before.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Numbers and patterns</h3><p>Counting real things, sorting, noticing shapes. Maths as something you do with your hands first.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set riverColor = "var(--paper)" %}{% include "partials/river.njk" %}

